---
config:
  theme: neo-dark
  look: handDrawn
  handDrawnSeed: 1
description: >-
  one representative block diagram, hand-drawn in the neo-dark theme (D307, D447): the leaf
  shapes and their inner lines sketched through w.outline; the composite, the block arrow,
  the edges and labels plain
---
block-beta
  columns 3
  start(("Start")) space check{"Valid?"}
  block:work["Work"]:3
    columns 3
    load["Load"] parse(["Parse"]) store[("Store")]
  end
  go<["Next"]>(right) report[["Report"]] done((("Done")))
  start --> check
  check -- "yes" --> work
  store -.-> report
  classDef hot fill:#f96,stroke:#333
  class done hot
